  },
  {
   "claim": "The map shows the Seventeen Provinces of the Netherlands (published by Claes Jansz. Visscher); a crease divides the Spanish south from the independent northern provinces",
   "source": "https://khm.at/en/object/2574 ; https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Art_of_Painting ; https://essentialvermeer.com/catalogue/art_of_painting.html"
  },
